# Line endings are LF in the repository and LF in the working tree.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true materialises every
# file with CRLF while Prettier's endOfLine default is "lf" — so `npm run
# format:check` fails on the whole tree immediately after a branch switch, on
# files nobody edited. Pinning eol=lf makes the checkout match what the
# formatter and CI expect, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, or otherwise not ours to normalise.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
package-lock.json -diff
